# Wentworth Institute Mechanical Engineering Laboratory Manual. Laboratory Study Guide.

**Authors:** Avakian, Harry, And Others

## Abstract
This publication is a laboratory study guide designed for mechanical engineering students. All of the experiments (with the exception of experiment No. 1) contained in the Mechanical Engineering Laboratory Manual have been included in this guide. Brief theoretical backgrounds, examples and their solutions, charts, graphs, illustrations, and sketches are also included for many experiments. The publication presents many questions to be answered, and many problems to be solved. Among other things, the questions and problems deal with pressure measurement, thermodynamics, fan laws, engine testing, and vapor compression systems. (GA)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=ED174462

